# 7xAir Launcher — Environment Configuration Example
# Copy this file to `.env` for local development (never commit `.env` with real secrets).

# =============================================================================
# 1. Microsoft Minecraft Java Edition Authentication (Public Desktop Client)
# =============================================================================
# Required for "Sign In with Microsoft" inside the 7xAir Windows launcher.
# Create an Azure / Microsoft Entra ID App Registration configured for:
#   - Supported account types: "Personal Microsoft accounts only"
#   - Authentication -> Advanced settings -> Allow public client flows: YES
#   - DO NOT create or embed a Client Secret (public desktop OAuth flow).
# See docs/MICROSOFT_AUTH_SETUP.md for complete step-by-step instructions.
# For GitHub Actions production builds, add this same value as a repository
# secret named SEVENXAIR_MSA_CLIENT_ID.
SEVENXAIR_MSA_CLIENT_ID=00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
